## Microsoft.Agents.AI API Surface - Comprehensive Reference

Based on my exploration of the NuGet packages, here's the complete API surface for building agents with tools:

### 1. **Main Agent Class: ChatClientAgent**

**Location:** `Microsoft.Agents.AI` (v1.13.0)  
**Namespace:** `Microsoft.Agents.AI`

**Constructor Signatures:**

```csharp
// Constructor 1: Detailed parameters
public ChatClientAgent(
    Microsoft.Extensions.AI.IChatClient chatClient,
    string instructions,                    // Optional system instructions
    string name,                            // Optional agent name
    string description,                     // Optional description
    IList<Microsoft.Extensions.AI.AITool> tools,    // Optional tools
    Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.ILoggerFactory loggerFactory,  // Optional
    IServiceProvider services)              // Optional for DI

// Constructor 2: Options-based
public ChatClientAgent(
    Microsoft.Extensions.AI.IChatClient chatClient,
    Microsoft.Agents.AI.ChatClientAgentOptions options,
    Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.ILoggerFactory loggerFactory,  // Optional
    IServiceProvider services)              // Optional for DI
```

**Key Properties:**
- `ChatClient` - Gets the underlying `IChatClient`
- `ChatHistoryProvider` - Gets the chat history provider
- `AIContextProviders` - Gets context providers
- `Name` - Gets/sets agent name
- `Description` - Gets/sets agent description

---

### 2. **Invocation Methods (Base Class: AIAgent)**

All invocation methods are inherited from `Microsoft.Agents.AI.AIAgent`:

**Synchronous Methods:**
```csharp
// No input
Task<AgentResponse> RunAsync(
    AgentSession session,
    AgentRunOptions options,
    CancellationToken cancellationToken)

// String message input
Task<AgentResponse> RunAsync(
    string message,
    AgentSession session,
    AgentRunOptions options,
    CancellationToken cancellationToken)

// ChatMessage input
Task<AgentResponse> RunAsync(
    ChatMessage message,
    AgentSession session,
    AgentRunOptions options,
    CancellationToken cancellationToken)

// Multiple messages input
Task<AgentResponse> RunAsync(
    IEnumerable<ChatMessage> messages,
    AgentSession session,
    AgentRunOptions options,
    CancellationToken cancellationToken)

// Structured output (generic versions with JsonSerializerOptions)
Task<AgentResponse<T>> RunAsync<T>(
    AgentSession session,
    JsonSerializerOptions jsonSerializerOptions,
    AgentRunOptions options,
    CancellationToken cancellationToken)
// ... and string/ChatMessage/IEnumerable variants
```

**Streaming Methods:**
```csharp
